RaktSetu
========

This project extends "Blood Bank Router" (https://github.com/sreeprasad/ekrakt), built at
JEVATHON (TypeSafe AI x The AI Collective) on 26 September 2026. The e-RaktKosh fetch logic in
src/raktsetu/eraktkosh.py is ported from that project's agent.py, and
data/eraktkosh_snapshot.json is that project's cached e-RaktKosh snapshot.

Blood stock data: e-RaktKosh, Ministry of Health and Family Welfare, Government of India
(https://eraktkosh.mohfw.gov.in). Used for a non-commercial demonstration. RaktSetu is not
affiliated with or endorsed by the Ministry.

All hospital requests, patients, clinical notes and pending orders in data/ and evals/ are
synthetic.
